<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" type="device"><diagram id="dp45-implementation-a" name="A: 요청별 원본 조회와 근거 조합"><mxGraphModel page="1" pageWidth="3840" pageHeight="2160"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="im" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Interaction Manager" style="swimlane;startSize=48;collapsible=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=30;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="238" width="600" height="170" /></mxCell><mxCell id="input" parent="im" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;InputReady&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;R23 / input revision / evidence refs&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="72" width="520" height="88" /></mxCell><mxCell id="scenario" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;같은 사용자 장면과 원본&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;R23: “지난번 설명한 기준에 제품 비교와 견적을 맞춰 제안서를 만들어줘.”&lt;br&gt;과거 원본: E20 설명 / P20 실제 전달 [0,52) / T21 → D21 개정 2 / T22 → D22 개정 1&lt;br&gt;검색 시작 전에는 위 ID가 target binding으로 주어지지 않는다. 검색 결과로 후보를 얻는다.&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;size=20;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="744" y="238" width="2360" height="170" /></mxCell><mxCell id="legend" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;도형과 실행 범위&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;직각 상자: Component / 내부 둥근 상자: 코드&lt;br&gt;원통: RAM 또는 DURABLE 상태&lt;br&gt;살구색: A/B에서 달라지는 내부 조직&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;size=20;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="3184" y="238" width="592" height="170" /></mxCell><mxCell id="rc" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Request Controller" style="swimlane;startSize=48;collapsible=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=30;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="470" width="600" height="450" /></mxCell><mxCell id="scope" parent="rc" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Scope / Adoption Gate&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;입력 개정, 허용 source 범위와 budget 등록&lt;br&gt;MeaningProposal의 현재성 검사와 채택&lt;br&gt;채택 후 Task Manager에 위임 요청&lt;br&gt;확정 Request와 사용 refs는 State Store&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="80" width="520" height="175" /></mxCell><mxCell id="history" parent="rc" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;History Read Port&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;주제 / 입력 / 채택 정정의 검색과 읽기&lt;br&gt;명시 REVISES / 당시 revision 반환&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="310" width="520" height="110" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ri" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Request Interpreter" style="swimlane;startSize=48;collapsible=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=30;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="1030" width="600" height="410" /></mxCell><mxCell id="read_tool" parent="ri" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Read Tool Runner&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;query_id / read_id / Request / attempt&lt;br&gt;EvidenceQuery → async 완료를 같은 caller로&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="80" width="520" height="125" /></mxCell><mxCell id="meaning" parent="ri" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Current Meaning Job&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;Bundle로 현재 목표와 Task 연결 제안&lt;br&gt;추가 읽기 또는 질문 / 자동 채택 아님&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="260" width="520" height="115" /></mxCell><mxCell id="model" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Model Access" style="swimlane;startSize=48;collapsible=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=30;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="1520" width="600" height="195" /></mxCell><mxCell id="api" parent="model" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Semantic API Client&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;scope / call ID / timeout / cancel / usage&lt;br&gt;현재 의미와 조건부 생산의 역할 분리&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="70" width="520" height="115" /></mxCell><mxCell id="cloud" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Cloud semantic model&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;외부 dependency / 입력 허용 범위만 전송&lt;br&gt;취소 실패 후 완료와 청구도 추적&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=hexagon;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="1785" width="600" height="115" /></mxCell><mxCell id="cm" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Context Manager" style="swimlane;startSize=48;collapsible=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=30;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="744" y="470" width="2360" height="1250" /></mxCell><mxCell id="rm" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Response Manager" style="swimlane;startSize=48;collapsible=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=30;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="3184" y="470" width="592" height="360" /></mxCell><mxCell id="response_read" parent="rm" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Response History Port&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;search(topic, range, cursor)&lt;br&gt;read(E20, revision, span)&lt;br&gt;read(P20, actual Text / Voice spans)&lt;br&gt;초안과 실제 전달을 구별&lt;br&gt;원문과 actual receipt: DURABLE&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="80" width="512" height="225" /></mxCell><mxCell id="tm" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Task Manager" style="swimlane;startSize=48;collapsible=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=30;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="3184" y="910" width="592" height="360" /></mxCell><mxCell id="task_read" parent="tm" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Task History Port&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;search(topic, range, cursor)&lt;br&gt;read(T21 / T22, result refs)&lt;br&gt;D21@v2 / D22@v1 / source revision&lt;br&gt;Agent Gateway의 확인 사건에서 저장&lt;br&gt;Task / 결과 참조: DURABLE&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="80" width="512" height="225" /></mxCell><mxCell id="pm" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Policy Manager" style="swimlane;startSize=48;collapsible=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=30;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="3184" y="1350" width="592" height="370" /></mxCell><mxCell id="policy" parent="pm" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Use Authorization Port&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;현재 scope와 permission epoch&lt;br&gt;checkAndRegisterUse(expected epoch)&lt;br&gt;철회 commit → 구 epoch 사용 차단&lt;br&gt;긴 read / 모델 완료를 기다리지 않음&lt;br&gt;권한 및 삭제 상태: DURABLE&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="80" width="512" height="210" /></mxCell><mxCell id="cache" parent="cm" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Source View Cache / 관계 cache&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;재사용 상태 / RAM + 선택적 영속화&lt;br&gt;key: source refs + 목적 / scope + 형식 version&lt;br&gt;값: 허용 발췌 / 요약 / 명시 또는 파생 관계&lt;br&gt;dependency vector / policy epoch / 유효성&lt;br&gt;hit에도 원본 확인 / 누락은 요청 경로에서 해결&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=cylinder;size=13;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF3E5;swimlaneFillColor=#FFF3E5;strokeColor=#B8753F;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=14;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="80" y="95" width="750" height="260" /></mxCell><mxCell id="invalidate" parent="cm" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Invalidation Handler&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;원본 변경 / 철회 / EvidenceDispute 수용&lt;br&gt;dependency로 cache와 활성 read 표시&lt;br&gt;원본 변경 → DIRTY / 재조회&lt;br&gt;철회 → 사용 차단 / purge 재시도&lt;br&gt;old job 완료는 현재 read에 합치지 않음&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF3E5;swimlaneFillColor=#FFF3E5;strokeColor=#B8753F;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1000" y="95" width="580" height="260" /></mxCell><mxCell id="changes" parent="cm" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Change / Control Inbox&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;owner ID / source revision / epoch&lt;br&gt;일반 cache 정리는 bounded queue&lt;br&gt;철회 gate는 이 backlog를 기다리지 않음&lt;br&gt;신호 gap은 사용 전 원본 검사로 탐지&lt;br&gt;cache 복구를 위한 변경이며 필수 생산 아님&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF3E5;swimlaneFillColor=#FFF3E5;strokeColor=#B8753F;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1720" y="95" width="560" height="260" /></mxCell><mxCell id="changes-slot0" parent="changes" vertex="1" value="" style="fillColor=white;strokeColor=#B8753F;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="370" y="222" width="30" height="30" /></mxCell><mxCell id="changes-slot1" parent="changes" vertex="1" value="" style="fillColor=white;strokeColor=#B8753F;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="408" y="222" width="30" height="30" /></mxCell><mxCell id="changes-slot2" parent="changes" vertex="1" value="" style="fillColor=white;strokeColor=#B8753F;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="446" y="222" width="30" height="30" /></mxCell><mxCell id="changes-slot3" parent="changes" vertex="1" value="" style="fillColor=white;strokeColor=#B8753F;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="484" y="222" width="30" height="30" /></mxCell><mxCell id="composer" parent="cm" vertex="1" value="Context Composer / 요청별 조합 작업" style="swimlane;startSize=48;collapsible=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF3E5;swimlaneFillColor=#FFF3E5;strokeColor=#B8753F;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="520" width="2280" height="690" /></mxCell><mxCell id="query" parent="composer" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Read Inbox / Admission&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;query + read ID / 목적 / deadline&lt;br&gt;scope와 자원 상한 검사&lt;br&gt;Cancel(read_id) / terminal reply 1회&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF3E5;swimlaneFillColor=#FFF3E5;strokeColor=#B8753F;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="120" width="500" height="155" /></mxCell><mxCell id="query-slot0" parent="query" vertex="1" value="" style="fillColor=white;strokeColor=#B8753F;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="310" y="117" width="30" height="30" /></mxCell><mxCell id="query-slot1" parent="query" vertex="1" value="" style="fillColor=white;strokeColor=#B8753F;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="348" y="117" width="30" height="30" /></mxCell><mxCell id="query-slot2" parent="query" vertex="1" value="" style="fillColor=white;strokeColor=#B8753F;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="386" y="117" width="30" height="30" /></mxCell><mxCell id="query-slot3" parent="query" vertex="1" value="" style="fillColor=white;strokeColor=#B8753F;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="424" y="117" width="30" height="30" /></mxCell><mxCell id="planner" parent="composer" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Read Pump / Planner&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;검색 단서 → owner별 bounded search&lt;br&gt;cache 확인 → 누락된 read만 병렬 시작&lt;br&gt;완료를 read set에 반영 / 추가 조회 결정&lt;br&gt;자유문 현재 의미는 Request Interpreter&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF3E5;swimlaneFillColor=#FFF3E5;strokeColor=#B8753F;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="690" y="120" width="700" height="185" /></mxCell><mxCell id="broker" parent="composer" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Owner Read Broker&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;owner adapter / bounded executor&lt;br&gt;search / read / validate async 작업&lt;br&gt;서로 다른 source의 전역 snapshot 없음&lt;br&gt;read_id + dependency + 결과를 callback&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF3E5;swimlaneFillColor=#FFF3E5;strokeColor=#B8753F;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1640" y="120" width="600" height="185" /></mxCell><mxCell id="bundle" parent="composer" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Bundle Builder / Use Guard&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;실제 전달 span과 원문 일치 검사&lt;br&gt;EvidenceBundle + QueryReceipt&lt;br&gt;누락 / source vector / read 범위&lt;br&gt;현재 권한과 attempt 확인 후 reply&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF3E5;swimlaneFillColor=#FFF3E5;strokeColor=#B8753F;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="460" width="500" height="180" /></mxCell><mxCell id="evidence" parent="composer" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Request Evidence Set (RAM)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;read_id → 후보 refs / source vector&lt;br&gt;발췌 / 명시 관계 / gaps / pending reads&lt;br&gt;일부 source 변경 시 해당 부분만 재조회&lt;br&gt;현재 Task binding의 확정 원본 아님&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=cylinder;size=13;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF3E5;swimlaneFillColor=#FFF3E5;strokeColor=#B8753F;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=14;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="690" y="460" width="700" height="180" /></mxCell><mxCell id="jobs" parent="composer" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Read Job Index (RAM)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;read_id / job_id / input revision&lt;br&gt;pending / done / cancelled / dependency&lt;br&gt;cancel handle / 실제 종료 / usage&lt;br&gt;재시작은 원본으로 read 재개 또는 재발행&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=cylinder;size=13;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF3E5;swimlaneFillColor=#FFF3E5;strokeColor=#B8753F;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=14;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1640" y="460" width="600" height="180" /></mxCell><mxCell id="trace" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;같은 요청의 정상 경로&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;1~4 후보 검색 → 유효 cache 활용 / 필요한 원본만 읽기&lt;br&gt;5~8 E20 [0,52), D21@v2, D22@v1 + 실제 읽은 범위 반환&lt;br&gt;같은 R24에서는 검증한 cache 재사용. 새 관계는 새 조회로 조합.&lt;br&gt;단순 코드 조합에 C-CONTEXT 호출을 강제하지 않는다.&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;size=20;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="744" y="1850" width="1110" height="205" /></mxCell><mxCell id="failure" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;변경과 취소에서 실행하는 코드&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;line-height:1.26;text-align:left;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;D21 개정 3 도착 → 관련 cache / read DIRTY → 그 부분 재조회&lt;br&gt;Cancel(read_id) → read set 사용 중지 → I/O cancel 요청&lt;br&gt;늦은 callback은 Job Index에서 종료만 회수. 새 요청에 합치지 않음.&lt;br&gt;공통 사용 gate가 변경 이후 사용을 다시 검사한다.&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;size=20;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=white;swimlaneFillColor=white;strokeColor=#263445;fontColor=#263445;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=27;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1924" y="1850" width="1180" height="205" /></mxCell><mxCell id="wire1" source="input" target="scope" edge="1" parent="1" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#195FBD;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=open;endFill=0;exitX=0.8461538461538461;exitY=1.0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.8461538461538461;entryY=0.0;entryPerimeter=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="wire2" source="scope" target="read_tool" edge="1" parent="1" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#263445;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=open;endFill=0;exitX=0.0;exitY=0.5;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.0;entryY=0.5;entryPerimeter=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points"><mxPoint as="point" x="34" y="637.5" /><mxPoint as="point" x="34" y="1172.5" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="wire3" source="read_tool" target="meaning" edge="1" parent="1" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#195FBD;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1.0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0.0;entryPerimeter=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="wire4" source="meaning" target="scope" edge="1" parent="1" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#195FBD;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;exitX=1.0;exitY=0.5;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=1.0;entryY=0.5;entryPerimeter=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points"><mxPoint as="point" x="684" y="1347.5" /><mxPoint as="point" x="684" y="637.5" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="wire5" source="meaning" target="api" edge="1" parent="1" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#263445;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=open;endFill=0;exitX=0